    "description": "Educational fossil specimen set from Dancing Bear, marked Fossil Collection 12 Genuine Specimens on the box. Each specimen comes in a resealable bag with a printed information card naming the fossil and describing it. Bagged specimens include Coral, Crinoid, Dinosaur bone, Coprolite, Brachiopod, Orthocereas, Gastropod, Clam, two Shark tooth bags, Trilobite and Ammonite. Also included are the printed Fossil Identification Guide booklet, the white cardboard storage box, and two loose unbagged stone specimens. A good starter set for classroom or collector display.\r\n\r\nCondition: Light shelf wear and edge scuffing on the box and booklet. Two specimens are loose outside of bags. Bags and cards show minor creasing.",
